-**Decoding:**
-To reconstruct an approximation $\hat{x}$ from a quantized index $q$:
-$$ \hat{x} = x_{min} + q \cdot \phi + \frac{\phi}{2} $$
-This represents the midpoint of the quantization bin [G].
